  "description": "A feeling of volume that fits in both hands. Smooth surface. Pinkish shiny bumps.\n1st of every month\nA new heart that suits your taste will be found.\nMonthly Chest September 2020\n•Raisin Intensive Care Room\n건포도 집중 치료실\nJisoo has a lot of troubles with his bigger chest than others.\nhe goes to the hospital with anxiety that there may be something wrong with his body...\nMonthly Chest October 2020\n•An Island to Become a Real Man\n진짜 남자가 되는 섬\nAndrew got into an accident during flight training.\nAfter being in distress on an unknown island, he is greeted strongly by the natives...\nMonthly Chest November 2020\n•Striker Becomes Goal\n골대가 된 스트라이커\nIntern reporter Lee Jae-yeon who interviewed sports star Kim Gun-woo.\nI witness the reversal of the player who has only lost talent in Inseong Bottom...\nMonthly Chest December 2020\n•Branara Panty Princess Rabbit Part-timer\n브라나라 팬티공주 토끼 알바생\nMonthly Chest January 2021\n•The Boarder Between Chocolateand Milk\n초코와 밀크의 경계\nMonthly Chest February 2021\n•A Man Calls with His Heart\n남자는 가슴으로 부른다\nMonthly Chest March 2021\n•Pit-A-Pat★Strawberry Picking\n두근두근★딸기 따 먹기\n•Pit-A-Pat ★White Day\n두근두근★화이트데이\n(Note the term 두근두근 is much like the Japanese Doki Doki term hence Pit-A-Pat)\nMonthly Chest April 2021\n•Rotor Date\n로터 데이트\n*Note: Each story has a Prologue and 3 chapters.*",
